  "content": "<p data-pid=\"EvykNuVO\">成绩刚出，答案是可以：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;750&#39; height=&#39;804&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"LQg2tkV6\">我从 2025 年 8 月底开始学日语，到 2026 年 7 月初 N2 考试前差不多学了 10 个月，也算是满足题目要求了。</p><p data-pid=\"uHZVCN6l\">简单统计一下考 N2 前我的时间分配：</p><p data-pid=\"Cljm8H4Q\">看番：170 小时（35 部，421 集）</p><p data-pid=\"12sf4P7y\">读轻小说：103 小时（9 本，约 90 万字）</p><p data-pid=\"VCj3ftVY\">背单词+语法：283 小时（8 千个单词，538 条语法）</p><p data-pid=\"1OvSHHOr\">应试备考：6 小时（考前一个月做了 3 套卷子）</p><p data-pid=\"h3uFYpvm\">总计在 300 天内学了 562 小时左右，平均每天不到两小时，对于上班族来说是差不多能腾出来的时间。</p><p data-pid=\"Zt0YeqP2\">使用的方法是沉浸式语言学习，没看过教材，也没上过网课，具体做法请见这些回答和文章：</p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1919168095198638425/answer/2054997204230842302\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2528a7887565a7ec91a1f9b80ea8803f.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/671671625\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ad9fd00d617ba3c3b92524e9c77ef66b.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005777505055967011\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习：萌萌二次元之路\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-62ee5a7955e0500d683f8200ad3f3364.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">日语学习：萌萌二次元之路</a><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"‍‌‬‌​​‌​﻿​‌​﻿⁠⁠​​‍​﻿​​​⁠​‬‬﻿‌‍​​​​⁠‌​‬﻿​‌​​​﻿​‍‍‌﻿基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">‍‌‬‌​​‌​﻿​‌​﻿⁠⁠​​‍​﻿​​​⁠​‬‬﻿‌‍​​​​⁠‌​‬﻿​‌​​​﻿​‍‍‌﻿基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档</a><p data-pid=\"01m_2sJ1\">我每周都会在 B 站发我平时学习日语的过程，仅供参考：</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nC8b6hEfU\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 无阻沉浸 ニューゲーム S1 (2026-08-23)\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">[学日语] 无阻沉浸 ニューゲーム S1 (2026-08-23)</a><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BC8m6VEr9\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 看週に一度クラスメイト買う話第八卷 (2026-08-22)\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">[学日语] 看週に一度クラスメイト買う話第八卷 (2026-08-22)</a><p data-pid=\"70u57L7S\">感觉年底可以去考个 N1 试试。</p><p data-pid=\"l_vDE0Gp\">我的日语学习统计信息可以在我的 GitHub 查看：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2806\" data-rawheight=\"2702\" data-original-token=\"v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2806\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2806&#39; height=&#39;2702&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2806\" data-rawheight=\"2702\" data-original-token=\"v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2806\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-958168cfe33c9539be26692662234615_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-reading-stats/books_reading_report.html\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"阅读统计报告\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">阅读统计报告</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2806\" data-rawheight=\"2670\" data-original-token=\"v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2806\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2806&#39; height=&#39;2670&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2806\" data-rawheight=\"2670\" data-original-token=\"v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2806\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8a6d2f9b58721b9ec44d57228c276184_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-mining-report/lapis_mining_timeline_report.html\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"日语挖词时间线\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">日语挖词时间线</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2806\" data-rawheight=\"2690\" data-original-token=\"v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2806\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2806&#39; height=&#39;2690&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2806\" data-rawheight=\"2690\" data-original-token=\"v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2806\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3acf0072961f3aa726427a3f15853ac7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-mining-report/lapis_source_report.html\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"日语挖卡报告\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">日语挖卡报告</a><p data-pid=\"gaS011P2\">还有我的 <span class=\"nolink\">jiten.moe</span> 主页：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"1610\" data-original-token=\"v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;1610&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"1610\" data-original-token=\"v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-58c060df978712b112986a33be370444_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//jiten.moe/profile/L-M-Sherlock\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"Profile - L-M-Sherlock - Jiten\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Profile - L-M-Sherlock - Jiten</a><p data-pid=\"h8ShLmp2\">自学日语，没有秘密，你也可以。</p>",
